    Another suggestion for NH 3.0.  If I'm not mistaken, a ring of
searching gives you one extra search per move.  Since finding a trap
or hidden doorway will occasionally take around 25 searches, I find 
that the ring of searching is useless (ok, you could polymorph it,
but that defeats its intended purpose).  How about making the ring
do a little work.  Something like 5 per move?  That would basically
give 15 searches per spot if you walk along a straight line, giving
a reasonable chance of discovering the trap/doorway while wearing
the ring.  I might not toss it if it actually did some discovering.



    Bob Clark


